insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'happy-new-year-and-2022s-challenges', 'Happy new year, and 2022’s challenges', 'Thanks for the past year; it has been great despite the pandemic’s impact on our activities!!! • Key events of 2021; TAT 2021, Friendlies, Solidarity Game, Merger, Palloliitto membership, Pikkujoulut. Plans for 2022; • Play in the Finnish League, level of competition, 6th division to be…',
  'Thanks for the past year; it has been great despite the pandemic’s impact on our activities!!!
• Key events of 2021;
TAT 2021, Friendlies, Solidarity Game, Merger, Palloliitto membership, Pikkujoulut.
Plans for 2022;
• Play in the Finnish League, level of competition, 6th division to be confirmed by January 15th, 2022.
• TAT 2022 (Summer)
• Membership, license, and insurance for the championship (145€/player)
• Restructuring of the staff, more details to come.
• Ps Remember to like, follow, participate and share established *Afro Foot Club platforms on social media.

> At your service, for an exciting year…',
  '/news/happy-new-year-and-2022s-challenges/cover.jpg', 'published', '2022-01-01T00:31:30Z')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'afro-foot-at-the-african-men-day-2022', 'Afro Foot at the African Men Day 2022', 'Strength of the prestige of a successful and serious team, our team was invited to participate in the football tournament marking the African Men’s Day 2022, organized by Diaspora Glitz Magazine. Activities to mark the event will begin with a football tournament in the morning at Tikkurilan…',
  'Strength of the prestige of a successful and serious team, our team was invited to participate in the football tournament marking the African Men’s Day 2022, organized by Diaspora Glitz Magazine.
Activities to mark the event will begin with a football tournament in the morning at Tikkurilan Urhielupuisto from 8:00 am – 13:00; after that, all the players and supporters will converge at the evening gala, where the trophy and medals will be delivered to the winner.

International Men’s Day celebrates the positive value men bring to the world, their families, and communities worldwide. We highlight positive role models and raise awareness of men’s well-being. The theme for 2022 is “Helping Men and Boys.” International Men’s Day is an opportunity for people everywhere of goodwill to appreciate and celebrate the men in their lives and the contribution they make to society for the greater good of all.',
  '/news/afro-foot-at-the-african-men-day-2022/cover.jpg', 'published', '2022-10-21T19:25:20Z')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'afro-foot-end-season-2022', 'Afro Foot end season 2022', 'We have come a long way since our club was founded. People believed in our project and our goals and joined us. The staff member, the sponsors, and the players gave body and soul to get us to the present level. It is, therefore, with pleasure that we chose the evening of reward to thank all…',
  'We have come a long way since our club was founded. People believed in our project and our goals and joined us. The staff member, the sponsors, and the players gave body and soul to get us to the present level. It is, therefore, with pleasure that we chose the evening of reward to thank all these different entities and people who have worked hard for the success of our common project.

> Thank you for joining us for the new season, and happy Christmas to you all, including our fans and followers.

Afro Foot Club',
  '/news/afro-foot-end-season-2022/cover.jpg', 'published', '2022-12-25T10:02:45Z')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

