insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'afro-award-2023-mvp-top-scorer', 'Afro Award 2023 – MVP & Top Scorer', 'Today, we are introducing another hero of 2023! Afro Foot Club presents its heroes of the 2023 season; Fabakary Ceesay joined Afro Foot Club in April 2022 and has already…',
  'Today, we are introducing another hero of 2023!

Afro Foot Club presents its heroes of the 2023 season; Fabakary Ceesay joined Afro Foot Club in April 2022 and has already impacted the team’s outstanding with two awards this year: MVP (Most Valuable Player) and the Top Scorer.
Fabacary promised to be the Top Scorer this season and has made it through. Congratulations!!!
Let’s discover how he achieved these two prices in one season.
Work hard
More accurately, he has to work harder than he thinks he needs to. Doing the minimum will win no points with people putting in extra effort. If you have more to give, do it.

Affirm others
The team spirit is critical for victory, and everyone is responsible for improving the mood if possible. Catch others doing good work and call them out. Fabakary has shown a genuine attitude, accepting criticism, and keeps working and bringing all he can for the team.

Impact the Games results.
To achieve its goals, a team needs members who give their all, give their best, and play to win. This is Fabakary, in some words.

Congratulations matte!!',
  '/news/afro-award-2023-mvp-top-scorer/cover.jpg', 'published', '2023-12-30T11:36:35Z')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

