insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'afro-foot-club-season-2026-launch-finnish-cup-registration-end-of-season-highlights', 'Season 2025 wrapped!', 'What a night for Afro Foot! Last Saturday, we wrapped up the season in an incredible atmosphere full of joy, unity, and appreciation for everyone who has been part of…',
  'What a night for Afro Foot!

Last Saturday, we wrapped up the season in an incredible atmosphere full of joy, unity, and appreciation for everyone who has been part of our journey.

While we didn’t hit every target we set for 2025, we achieved meaningful milestones and grew stronger together. No matter the league level we play in, our commitment to the future remains serious and ambitious. Afro Foot is here to stay, building a lasting foundation and creating opportunities for the next generation.

At our 5th end-of-season events, we celebrated what truly defines us: talent, resilience, potential, and discipline. We’ve faced challenges, even from places where support should have been natural, but every obstacle has only sharpened our determination. We don’t shy away from challenges; we rise to them. And with the young, hungry squad we now have, we’re excited for what’s ahead.

We’re proud to announce that Afro Foot is officially registered for Season 2026 and the Finnish Cup 2026. Our 2026 story has already begun, and it’s looking bright.

We’re currently working on new sponsorships and will share updates soon.

In the meantime, feel free to pre-order your 2026 kits and be part of the journey early!

Thank you for standing with us. The best is yet to come.

Pictures by #Juke

@followers @topfans [Suomen Palloliitto](https://www.facebook.com/Palloliitto) [Jalkapallon Suomen Cup](https://www.facebook.com/suomencup) #AfroFootClub #Season2026 #GrowingTogetherr #footballfamily

