insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'idrissa-cisses-move-from-afrofoot-to-valtti', 'Idrissa Cisse’s move to Valtti!', '🚨⚽ OFFICIAL TRANSFER ANNOUNCEMENT ⚽🚨 Afro Foot Club (Div. 5) is proud to announce a transfer agreement with Valtti (Div. 3) for our talented player, Idrissa Cisse. 📅 Transfer Date:…',
  '🚨⚽ **OFFICIAL TRANSFER ANNOUNCEMENT** ⚽🚨

**Afro Foot Club (Div. 5)** is proud to announce a transfer agreement with **Valtti (Div. 3)** for our talented player, **Idrissa Cisse**.

📅 **Transfer Date:** March 6, 2026

After playing the **first half of the 2025 season with Afro Foot Club**, Idrissa’s outstanding performances and talent have attracted attention from several higher-division teams. Over the past months, we were approached by multiple clubs.

After careful discussions with the player, we believe **Valtti** is the **best step for his development at this stage of his career**. 🤝

✍️ **Contract Details:**
• **1-year contract with Valtti**
• **Option to extend the agreement**

We are proud to see Idrissa take this next step and continue his football journey at a higher competitive level. Your dedication, discipline, and talent have made a big impact at Afro Foot Club. 💪⚽

👏 Please join us in wishing **Idrissa Cisse** the very best with **Valtti** in this new chapter!

#afrofootclub #footballtransfer #soccernews #playerdevelopment #valtti #Montelintegalactic',
  '/news/idrissa-cisses-move-from-afrofoot-to-valtti/cover.jpg', 'published', '2026-03-07T08:53:01Z')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

