  '💚💛 Player Spotlight: Amir Safizadeh Noormohammad 💛💚

Since joining the team in 2023, Amir has proven to be a dedicated left fullback, consistently giving his best in each game and showing remarkable resilience. Having played 41 official league matches, he has gained the admiration of both teammates and fans.

🏆 In 2025, Amir’s dedication was rewarded with the Most Improved Player Award, and he keeps getting better!

We’re proud of you, Amir. Keep pushing forward! 💚💛

