insert into news_posts (slug, title, excerpt, body_md, cover_path, status, published_at) values (
  'omar-jarra-true-legend', 'Omar Jarra, true legend!', 'Player Spotlight: Omar Jarra From the very first day Afro Foot took the field, Omar Jarra has been there, leading, inspiring, and giving everything for the team. He is not…',
  '💚💛 Player Spotlight: Omar Jarra 💛💚

From the very first day Afro Foot took the field, Omar Jarra has been there, leading, inspiring, and giving everything for the team. He is not just a player; he’s part of this club’s foundation and one of its true legends.

Over the years, Omar has become a symbol of dedication and pride. With 72 official matches and over 100 friendly games played, he has represented Afro Foot through every challenge and triumph. Every goal celebrated, every victory earned. Omar has been right there, playing his heart out for the badge and the fans.

His influence extends beyond the field. Younger players admire him for his leadership, work ethic, and unwavering dedication to the team. Omar has helped define Afro Foot’s identity, which is rooted in loyalty, perseverance, and unity.

💚 Thank you, Omar, for being with us since day one and for everything you’ve done and continue to do for Afro Foot. Here’s to many more moments together! 💛this club’s foundation',
  '/news/omar-jarra-true-legend/cover.jpg', 'published', '2026-03-15T08:34:16Z')
